# NexTradeAI — local only

This workspace is **NexTradeAI** app + marketing site for **local development**.

## Local dev (one command)

```bash
bun run local
```

| Service | URL |
|---------|-----|
| Marketing site | http://localhost:8080 |
| App (Expo web) | http://localhost:8081 |
| API | http://localhost:3000 |

Auth/DB calls proxy read-only to `auraai-vps.com` — no deploys, no DB writes from this repo.

## Do not deploy from here

**Do not run** `./scripts/deploy-website-full.sh` or other Aura VPS deploy scripts from this repo unless the user explicitly asks. The live site at **auraai-vps.com** is the **Aura AI** site (see `aura-ai-app/`).

